B = [
('Carhartt','North America','1900s-present','workwear','In the style of Carhartt, hard-wearing American utility design. Heavy, tightly woven cotton duck with a dry, slightly rough hand, finished in tobacco brown, faded tan, charcoal black, moss green and washed navy. Surfaces look broken in, with soft creasing, pale fading at the folds and honest wear. Construction is visible and reinforced, with bold triple stitching, metal rivets, boxy generous proportions and sturdy flat seams. Branding is a small square label in a contrasting block colour with plain, upright, slightly condensed capital lettering, repeated on hang tags in kraft brown and black with cream type. Everything feels durable, unfussy, practical and built to be used for decades.'),
('Puma','Europe','1960s-present','sportswear','In the style of Puma, sleek athletic design with a confident, fast, low-slung attitude. A leaping big cat silhouette is the recurring emblem, set beside heavy, bold, wide lowercase and capital lettering in black, white or red. Long tapering stripe forms sweep diagonally across surfaces as a single flowing accent curve. Palette is crisp white, deep black and signal red, with royal blue, forest green, mustard and cream for retro colour-blocked pairings. Materials include soft suede with a velvety nap, smooth nylon, terry cloth, glossy synthetic panels and clean piping. Graphic layouts use big flat colour fields, repeated logo patterns and a cool, 1970s sporty polish.'),
('Uniqlo','East Asia','2000s-present','fashion','In the style of Uniqlo, calm, precise, utilitarian simplicity. Forms are clean and regular, with no ornament, flat planes, tidy seams and a minimal, modular logic that repeats across everything. Materials are soft smooth cotton, fine knit, brushed fleece and light technical fabric in a quiet palette of white, grey, navy, black and beige. A single saturated signal red square carries bold white capital lettering in blocky katakana style and Latin type, and this red-and-white pairing runs through labels and packaging. Packaging is crisp white cardboard and clear film with a neat grid of small type, ordered, honest, generous with whitespace and made for everyday use.'),
('Vivienne Westwood','Europe','1970s-present','fashion','In the style of Vivienne Westwood, theatrical, rebellious and romantic British design that mixes punk with historical grandeur. A signature orb emblem with a ring around a small sphere and a cross sits in gleaming gold or silver metal, embossed, stitched or printed. Tartan is the main pattern, in clashing red, black, green, yellow, pink and lilac checks, cut on the bias and often twisted. Materials include crushed velvet, brocade, corset-like satin, leather, pearls, chains and safety-pin hardware. Lettering is a flowing, curly serif script in black on white. Shapes are asymmetric, draped, nipped and exaggerated, with ruffles and bows, both aristocratic and defiantly anarchic.'),
('Swatch','Europe','1980s-present','accessories','In the style of Swatch, playful, pop, graphic design in lightweight moulded plastic with a glossy, jelly-like sheen. Forms are smooth, rounded, thin and flat, and often translucent or skeleton-like to reveal colourful inner parts. Palette is loud and saturated, with primary red, yellow, blue, green, hot pink and orange against black and white. Surfaces carry bold stripes, dots, zigzags, colour-block geometry, comic-like motifs and art-collaboration prints. A small white cross-in-square emblem and a chunky italic sans-serif wordmark appear in white on red. Packaging is cheerful, with boxes covered in busy patchwork graphics, tilted lids and clear windows, colourful, collectible and fun.'),
('Marimekko','Europe','1950s-present','textiles','In the style of Marimekko, fresh Finnish modernism built on oversized, hand-drawn graphic prints. Giant simplified poppy-like blooms, stripes, dots, checks and organic blobs fill the surface at huge scale, cropped boldly at the edges. Palette is vivid and flat, with poppy red, hot pink, orange, cobalt, deep navy, leaf green and black on crisp white or inky dark grounds. Shapes have soft brushed edges, a naive painterly quality and no shading. Materials are sturdy cotton, linen-like weaves, ceramic glaze and coated paper with a matte finish. Lettering is a simple, widely spaced sans-serif wordmark. Everything feels joyful, democratic, bright and playfully abstract.'),
('Hunter','Europe','1950s-present','outdoor','In the style of Hunter, polished British countryside practicality with a glossy, waterproof finish. Smooth, seamless, sleek rubber and coated surfaces have a high sheen, with a subtle matte bloom, in deep racing green, navy, black, olive and bright seasonal colours such as red, yellow and pink. Shapes are clean, rounded and streamlined with minimal seams and tidy moulded edges. The emblem is a bold red rectangular badge with thick white capital lettering, repeated in strict upright sans-serif type. Heritage touches include tweedy checks, waxed cotton, brass hardware, dark green boxes and thin white rules. Refined, tough, rain-ready, quietly classic and tidy.'),
('Stetson','North America','1860s-present','accessories','In the style of Stetson, proud, rugged American frontier heritage with an old-world crest. A detailed engraved emblem of two animals flanking a shield, with a scroll banner and a founding year, is printed in brown, gold or cream. Lettering is tall, stately, widely spaced serif capitals in burnt orange, chocolate or cream. Materials are dense fur felt, burnished leather, braided cord, canvas, brass and washed denim with a sun-faded feel. Palette is silver belly grey, tan, saddle brown, black, deep burgundy and denim blue. Round, domed, generous shapes, soft rolled edges and warm, dignified craftsmanship. Packaging is circular or boxy in cream and maroon, with gold stamped type.'),
('New Balance','North America','1980s-present','footwear','In the style of New Balance, understated, grown-up sporty design with a calm, confident, practical air. Palette is heathered grey as the core, joined by navy, burgundy, forest green, cream and white, with occasional bright teal, volt yellow or coral accents. Textures mix soft suede, fine mesh and matte synthetic in layered overlays with muted tonal blocking. A large capital N emblem in an angled, slashing form is the recurring mark, often in a contrasting colour. Lettering is plain, bold, upright sans-serif capitals. Packaging uses sturdy boxes in red, teal or white with simple tidy type. Nothing is flashy, everything is balanced, refined and comfortable.'),
('The North Face','North America','1960s-present','outdoor','In the style of The North Face, bold, rugged expedition design with a technical, mountain-inspired look. The emblem is three curved, nested arcs forming a half dome, set beside heavy, tightly stacked uppercase sans-serif lettering in white on red, or black on white. Strong colour blocking in red, black, white, yellow, royal blue and teal, split by diagonal seams and panels. Materials are glossy ripstop nylon, quilted puffy baffles, fleece, matte coated fabrics and webbing, with reflective piping and taped edges. Shapes are chunky, padded and geometric, and the brand has a confident, adventurous, high-performance character with oversized graphics and clean flat colour fields.'),
]
